#. Tag: title
#: survey-manual.docbook:2
#, no-c-format
msgid "What This Manual Contains"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: survey-manual.docbook:4
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This user manual is intended to describe the contents and use of the "
"&kdevelop; &kdevrelease; Integrated Development Environment (IDE) from a "
"user's point of view. It is not a programming manual, nor does it describe "
"the development process in detail. Its only aim is to guide you in the "
"handling of the IDE."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: survey-manual.docbook:7
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here you will find information on the following topics:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: link
#: survey-manual.docbook:12
#, no-c-format
msgid "Getting Started with &kdevelop; &mdash; a Guided Tour"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: survey-manual.docbook:14
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Gives you a quick start on the use of this &IDE;, introducing the basic "
"steps of how to work on a project."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: link
#: survey-manual.docbook:18
#, no-c-format
msgid "Overview of the Features of &kdevelop;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: survey-manual.docbook:21
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Extends the guided tour in the previous chapter, giving an overall view of "
"what is built-in within &kdevelop; and gets you acquainted with the look and "
"feel of this &IDE;."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: link
#: survey-manual.docbook:28
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configuring &kdevelop;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: survey-manual.docbook:30
#, no-c-format
msgid "Shows how you can tailor the &IDE; to suit your needs."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: link
#: survey-manual.docbook:35
#, no-c-format
msgid "Getting started: the &appwizard;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: survey-manual.docbook:38
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Describes the basics of how to set up a new project in &kdevelop; using the "
"built-in &appwizard;."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: link
#: survey-manual.docbook:44
#, no-c-format
msgid "Editing tools"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: survey-manual.docbook:46
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"All you need to write your source files: using the editor, searching for "
"text both locally and project-wide, up to integrating new files and classes "
"into the project."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: link
#: survey-manual.docbook:53
#, no-c-format
msgid "The File Browsers"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: survey-manual.docbook:55
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Demonstrates various tools to look at the structure of your project and how "
"to access the files you want to work with."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: link
#: survey-manual.docbook:61
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Class Browsers"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: survey-manual.docbook:63
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Describes one of the most powerful tools of &kdevelop; which lets you "
"navigate through class dependencies and allows you to easily create and "
"access the classes and methods you need."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: link
#: survey-manual.docbook:71
#, no-c-format
msgid "Documentation"
msgstr "Documentacion"

#. Tag: para
#: survey-manual.docbook:73
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Shows how to access the rich built-in documentation &kdevelop; provides and "
"tells you how to create documentation of your project, concise and powerful "
"&API; documentation providing you an overall view of all your project "
"sources as well as docbook-based user documentation."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: link
#: survey-manual.docbook:81
#, no-c-format
msgid "Building and Project Management"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: survey-manual.docbook:84
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Deals with the creation and management of your project; describing the "
"basics of autoconf and automake as well as how to set up custom make files "
"and how to use compiler or make options to tailor your application to suit "
"your needs."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: link
#: survey-manual.docbook:92
#, no-c-format
msgid "Advanced Build Management"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: survey-manual.docbook:95
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Looks at ways to keep multiple build configurations, to cross-compile for "
"diverse platforms, or to make an embedded system using the <application>Qt/"
"embedded</application> library."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: link
#: survey-manual.docbook:102
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Debugger Interface"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: survey-manual.docbook:104
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Describes how to use the integrated <application>gdb</application> debugger "
"interface so you can hunt down bugs without leaving &kdevelop;."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: link
#: survey-manual.docbook:119
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using CVS"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: survey-manual.docbook:121
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Tells you how you can maintain your project using the CVS versioning system; "
"a must, especially if many developers work on the same project."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: survey-manual.docbook:137
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Some commonly used information has been put into the <emphasis>appendix</"
"emphasis>. Amongst others this consists of:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: link
#: survey-manual.docbook:143
#, no-c-format
msgid "Installing &kdevelop;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: survey-manual.docbook:145
#, no-c-format
msgid "Tells you where to obtain &kdevelop; and how to get it up and running."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: link
#: survey-manual.docbook:153
#, no-c-format
msgid "In a Nutshell &mdash; Tips and Tricks"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: survey-manual.docbook:156
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A quick reference to commonly used commands and actions. And a short guide "
"to solve common problems when working with &kdevelop;."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: link
#: survey-manual.docbook:163
#, no-c-format
msgid "Development on &UNIX;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: survey-manual.docbook:165
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A historical overview of &UNIX; program development, the main tools "
"necessary and why you need an &IDE;."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: link
#: survey-manual.docbook:181
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configuration Files Used by &kdevelop;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: survey-manual.docbook:183
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Lists the files &kdevelop; uses to save its internal information. This is "
"particularly useful in case something went wrong with your setup."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: link
#: survey-manual.docbook:190
#, no-c-format
msgid "Plugin Tools"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: survey-manual.docbook:191
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Lists the pluggable tools you can use to taylor the capabilities of "
"&kdevelop; to your needs."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: link
#: survey-manual.docbook:201
#, no-c-format
msgid "KDevelop User Interface Mode Examples"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: survey-manual.docbook:202
#, no-c-format
msgid "Shows user interface modes."
msgstr ""

